\name{semantica_validate}\alias{semantica_validate}\title{Attach participant-response validation to an existing selected scale}\usage{semantica_validate(result, responses, ordered = NULL, verbose = TRUE)}\arguments{\item{result}{A completed high-level SEMANTICA result.}\item{responses}{Data frame or matrix containing one column for every selected item ID.}\item{ordered}{Optional ordered-item specification passed to the established response-data ESEM path.}\item{verbose}{Logical; print a concise completion message.}}\description{Runs the existing participant-response validation helpers on the stored selected item set and factor structure. It does not regenerate items, recompute embeddings, rerun ACO, or alter scale selection.}\details{The adapter requires the stored fit-cutoff configuration so the established response-validation path can be reproduced rather than replaced by new heuristic defaults.}\value{A copy of \code{result} with response validation and updated evidence-family metadata attached.}
